  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-134352",
  "summary": "Rclone 1.51.0 before 1.76.0 Authentication Bypass via serve sftp Auth-Proxy Cache",
  "details": "Rclone from 1.51.0 before 1.76.0 contains an authentication bypass vulnerability in serve sftp --auth-proxy because the generateCacheKey cache key omits the authentication method. Attackers knowing a victim's base64 public key can submit it as a password from the same client IP to reuse the cached entry and gain read-write VFS access.",
